rw-contract v1
id: N07
name: true-claim-wrong-proof
label: negative; R01's true claim with a derivation citing the wrong axiom
semantics: omega.v0.wrap
domain: wrap
widths: 8 16 32 64
overflow: wrap modulo 2^w
rounding: none
shape: scalar
aliasing: none
effects: none
params: a b
ops: -
assume: -
lhs: (add (add x a) b)
rhs: (add x (add a b))
derive:
  (add x (add a b)) by mul-assoc
end
